sequenceDiagram
    actor Visitor
    participant Panel as ChatPanel
    participant State as React state
    Visitor->>Panel: Open chat
    Panel->>State: Initialize sample messages
    Visitor->>Panel: Enter team message
    Panel->>State: Append local message
    State-->>Panel: Render updated list
    Note over Panel,State: No server or other participant receives this message
    Visitor->>Panel: Select AI Preview
    Visitor->>Panel: Submit preview prompt
    Panel->>State: Append user message
    Panel->>State: Append fixed demo response after delay
